 the corresponding identity leaves every entry unchanged.\n\n$$\nI_3A=A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719223 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1025ba2b-c82a-58e8-89f5-ffd2aa4822d0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 & -6 \\\\ -6 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 4 & 3 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719214} {:answer/id #uuid "17358251-78ea-5250-88bd-3c8edabd5feb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -5 & -6 \\\\ 3 & -3 & -3 \\\\ 4 & -6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719217} {:answer/id #uuid "23fe47aa-6626-5728-955f-8ade3a645642" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -6 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -3 & -3 \\\\ -6 & -5 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719219} {:answer/id #uuid "a46fcb78-ccce-554c-8fb7-996c6ed1ce62" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -5 & -6 \\\\ -3 & -3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719237} {:answer/id #uuid "ae6883b2-3613-5e2b-95c6-d5b3ec22cfb9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -3 & 4 \\\\ -5 & -3 & -6 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719240}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a46fcb78-ccce-554c-8fb7-996c6ed1ce62" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -5 & -6 \\\\ -3 & -3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719237} :answer-field/id #uuid "62342348-88d4-5e94-a4bb-000ee1b993f7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719230}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "2f7bd37c-dd6e-52f8-8b9b-9960734b2d92" :question/problem "Calculate $I_3D$, given that $I_3$ is the $3 \\times 3$ identity matrix.\n\n<div cla