ss=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$MC=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{entry-1-1}}</td><td>{{entry-1-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{entry-2-1}}</td><td>{{entry-2-2}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "$C$ has ones on its diagonal and zeros elsewhere, so $C=I_2$. Both matrices are $2 \\times 2$, so the product is defined. Multiplication by the corresponding identity leaves every entry unchanged.\n\n$$\nMC=M=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFor example, its first entry is $(0)\\cdot1+(6)\\cdot0=0$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719406 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3a489bb8-f766-550e-8f9c-4042f2084ec4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719365}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3a489bb8-f766-550e-8f9c-4042f2084ec4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719365} :answer-field/id #uuid "28db56e2-6ef3-51b1-80d6-3cbbf9b23c63" :answer-field/key "entry-2-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719364} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9cd0bcf2-8f03-542c-bc30-c0848656a83f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719394}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9cd0bcf2-8f03-542c-bc30-c0848656a83f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719394} :answer-field/id #uuid "3dfc92c6-1594-5198-a736-c4056dcf1e4d" :answer-field/key "entry-1-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719367} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00799f42-c439-5427-af31-5091fde6ce54" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719360}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "00799f42-c439-5